可惜你还没死","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066801873663971695"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-16T08:19:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066797923330101341"],"id":"2066797923330101341","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1536,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"一直笑着的你，为什么一定要饰演这场让人羡慕的痛苦。\n————你的痛苦叫幸福。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066797923330101341"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-16T08:19:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066797869043204409"],"id":"2066797869043204409","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4176,"like_count":53,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":12},"text":"亲自否定自己幸福，又渴望不痛苦。这样你就满意了？把别人安慰你的话语，编织你的新剧本，然后继续饰演痛苦，继续用“痛苦无法被比较”作为挡箭牌。然后又是一波安慰。这就是你设计的死循环？","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066797869043204409"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-16T08:17:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066797326057050250"],"id":"2066797326057050250","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":47,"impression_count":176381,"like_count":4622,"quote_count":23,"reply_count":178,"retweet_count":187},"text":"看个动漫就要抽烟，我看东京喰种我要开始吃人了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066797326057050250"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-16T08:16:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066796964797382924"],"id":"2066796964797382924","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1899,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":5},"text":"以前他们说我瞎的时候 我恨不得告诉所有人你的好 现在不说了 我承认","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066796964797382924"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-16T08:14:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066796571149435005"],"id":"2066796571149435005","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":84,"impression_count":40319,"like_count":771,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":42,"retweet_count":138},"text":"我不想和好，也不想见你，但我想你。其实想的也不是你，而是我毫无保留喜欢一个人的那段日子。不想和好，是知道没结果，不想见面，是知道没意义。但我想你，是因为真心喜欢过。可是我们终究无法和解，你或许已经不是我记忆中的那个人了，我怀念的可能跟你也没关系了。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066796571149435005"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-15T05:44:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066396492001321108"],"id":"2066396492001321108","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":6783,"like_count":137,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":10},"text":"https://t.co/bENKI6I4lU","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066396492001321108"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-15T01:04:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066325909251191062"],"id":"2066325909251191062","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5047,"like_count":54,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"其实我会把所有事情都规划好然后不去做。 https://t.co/6pebBmWVo4","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066325909251191062"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-15T01:01:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066325232378696011"],"id":"2066325232378696011","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2118,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"其实我有蛮久没有想起过前夫了，也没有之前那样那么痛苦了，随之而来的是我自己对自己的认知痛苦","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066325232378696011"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-14T19:48:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2066246502822154565"],"id":"2066246502822154565","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1420,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我基本上私信其实都会回的\n欢迎来碰碰运气\n给我打个招呼，说点好话\n最近很需要大家的情绪价值\n给我打赏的几位朋友，无论多少，我都很感谢…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2066246502822154565"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2066884200226247148","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3jueqimre8uj1nwzlguqyxd8av53